            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="general"><strong>GENERAL</strong><a href="https://serveradmincore.eeldev.com/changelog/1-0-1#general" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to general" title="Direct link to general" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li class="">Kicked players now get to see why they were kicked</li>
<li class=""><strong>On Auto Kick Warning</strong> now includes the full warning <strong>Message</strong></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="added"><strong>ADDED</strong><a href="https://serveradmincore.eeldev.com/changelog/1-0-1#added" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to added" title="Direct link to added" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>On Auto Kick Warning Cancelled</strong> event</li>
<li class=""><strong>On Kicked</strong> event on the ServerAdminCore Player Component</li>
<li class=""><strong>On Local Player Kicked</strong> event on the ServerAdminCore subsystem</li>
<li class=""><strong>Was Kicked</strong>, <strong>Get Last Kick Reason</strong> and <strong>Clear Last Kick Reason</strong> functions</li>
</ul>]]></content:encoded>
